  "limitations": "Original reconstruction of the carrier smoke-shield Type 96 triple measured against GameModels3D pjsa108 (jga004); the twelve-sided drum is fixed and the shield trains on it; the guns inside reuse the open triple's gun with a simplified hidden cradle; the notch floor under the slots is lowered 0.11 m so the flash hiders clear it at -10 degrees; standalone fidelity and articulation acceptance have not been certified.",
